// Dialog :
"P2835858097" "Oh... You again.<br><br>Well, it looks like you aren't any worse for wear, and you completed the task at hand.<br><br>Good work... for a rookie.<br><br>Don't get all emotional about it, not anyone can walk in and be a pro like me.<br><br>It's okay, really. Just give it time, your day will come."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - P_SL1-2_NP_Reese_L_Task2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ResistanceGatheringClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P402306240" "Resistance Gathering"
// DetailString :
"P656759400" "Warrant tells you that he beat some information out of a Resistance fighter about a Resistance gathering happening down in the tunnels right now. He gave you the alleged location and told you to clear it out for him."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P946000016" "Do you know why we're here, {HeroName}? It's because the Resistance thinks that the subway and the tunnels under Nova Praetoria are safe.<br><br>Warrant reports that he got a confession from a Resistance fighter about where they're meeting. I want you to get the info from Warrant and then go down there, find out where those cockroaches are hiding and  hospitalize every last one of 'em."
// SendOffString :
"P1135340368" "I'm serious, if even one of them can walk after you are done, I'll snap both of your legs off at the hip. I'm not even kidding."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - P_SL1-2_NP_Reese_L_Task2_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2267167991" "Talk to Warrant"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P593104907" "Warrant is a busy man, don't keep him waiting."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2471281200" "It's simple, {HeroName}, the Resistance is gathering up supplies down in the tunnels. I've gotten information on where this secret cache of equipment is, but Reese has seen fit to give you a shot at showing what you are capable of.<br><br>Go in, smash the supply cache, and take out as many of those scum sucking Resistance punks as you can. When you're all done report back to Reese.<br><br>If everything goes smoothly, the PPD will show up with everyone tagged and bagged and just get stuck doing the paperwork and clean up."

