"P1665196705" "Not bad, not bad. You seem to be pulling your weight pretty well around here.<br><br>Marauder told me that you've got what it takes. Frankly, I don't see what he does in you.<br><br>For example; crates and boxes don't hit back. Top Dogs always hit back.<br><br>I think it's time you upped your education on the finer points of being in Powers Division, {HeroName}. I'm giving you your shot at being one of us."
