"P547333192" "Oh please. You can't be serious. You're {HeroName}? I was expecting so much more. Well, let's get to it. This shouldn't take long."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - WarrantDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1563406589" "Alright {HeroName}. You've gotten past Stern and Aria, so you must be able to handle yourself. Let's see what you've got."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - RiptideDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3000778788" "You ready to die, {HeroName}?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - ZaneDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P558625210" "The others were nothing. If you want my respect, you'll have to prove yourself to me in combat. Whenever you are ready."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - MarauderDialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2736540827" "Well well well, if you haven't turned out to be a big dog after all. I've got a lot of respect for you, {HeroName}, but compared to strength, that will get you nothing.<br><br>I have one last challenger for you to face, and I know he's been eager to kick your teeth in.<br><br>Are you ready to face Reese?"

