"P1948371591" "Stern, broken and beaten"
// DetailString :
"P19906875" "You left Stern a broken man, proving that he is far beneath you in the powers division pecking order."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - DefeatAriaClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3160821468" "Aria, crushed and cowed"
// DetailString :
