// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - DefeatZaneClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P653232366" "Zane, bruised and bested"
// DetailString :
"P1752277648" "You bested Zane at his own game, proving that his technique was found lacking, and that you are the best of the best."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - DefeatReeseClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1369760667" "Reese, second best is first loser"
// DetailString :
"P2076326186" "You defeated Reese, proving that you are the toughest, the meanest, and the baddest that Powers Division has to offer... next to Marauder, of course!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P528651835" "It's time to show what you are really made of, {HeroName}. Among the Powers Division there are the few, the powerful, Marauder's Top Dogs.<br><br>The other dogs think you might have what it takes to join us at the top, but I'm still not sure. If you want to hang with us, you'll need to challenge the Top Dogs and impress them.<br><br>A word of warning, nothing really impresses me."
// AcceptString :
"P2695900188" "Accept the challenge"
// SendOffString :
"P782640619" "Well, you've got the spirit, that's a start at least. Here's a list of the other Dogs and where you can find them.<br><br>This isn't a friendly competition, {HeroName}, if you hold back even a little, you are going to pay for it with misery. The Top Dogs do not screw around.<br><br>Now get out of here."

